      "asset": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Audio/Voice/Story/Main04/main04_taeon_supp_005.wav",
      "guid": "2b77adb51516d734aa5348f18fc42086",
      "sha256": "d01fe51d7c8c6d94a4411477ffd6b98ab3c62fe99267ed0bef11384383afdf1e",
      "seconds": 2.71
    },
    {
      "id": "main04_miel_supp_009",
      "quest": 4,
      "speaker": "미엘",
      "character_id": "companion_miel",
      "voice_id": "Sulafat",
      "text": "저도 볼 겁니다.\n이번에는 순서대로요.",
      "source_file": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Scripts/World/MainQuest04FieldFlow.cs",
      "source_line": "229",
      "asset": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Audio/Voice/Story/Main04/main04_miel_supp_009.wav",
      "guid": "fa9ec6a96bb329840be3727f31a9c598",
      "sha256": "4b9817cdf1df61435f70e39afb2eeac6242e35628c27555e829386d5d681bac9",
      "seconds": 2.73
    },
    {
      "id": "main04_taeon_supp_006",
      "quest": 4,
      "speaker": "태온",
      "character_id": "companion_taeon",
      "voice_id": "Gacrux",
      "text": "제가 본 움직임과\n이곳에서 있었던 일까지 합치면…",
      "source_file": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Scripts/World/MainQuest04FieldFlow.cs",
      "source_line": "231",
      "asset": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Audio/Voice/Story/Main04/main04_taeon_supp_006.wav",
      "guid": "6dc204a95cf23ea418494ccc6c56a51a",
      "sha256": "3373b9b988968d531a996e83a111153aa606e5829ce7d8610d23aff9238055ba",
      "seconds": 4.63
    },
    {
      "id": "main04_miel_supp_010",
      "quest": 4,
      "speaker": "미엘",
      "character_id": "companion_miel",
      "voice_id": "Sulafat",
      "text": "초원보다 더 안쪽에서\n무언가가 벌어지고 있는 것 같아요.",
      "source_file": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Scripts/World/MainQuest04FieldFlow.cs",
      "source_line": "233",
      "asset": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Audio/Voice/Story/Main04/main04_miel_supp_010.wav",
      "guid": "9f9335a565a41404fbc40b36e0755950",
      "sha256": "fce4356068527f1656f23c71a9d0c50c2201ab6ca79f8c13e21721d5bbc134ee",
      "seconds": 3.82
    },
    {
      "id": "main04_taeon_supp_007",
      "quest": 4,
      "speaker": "태온",
      "character_id": "companion_taeon",
      "voice_id": "Gacrux",
      "text": "여기서 더 들어가는 건\n지금은 위험할 것 같습니다.",
      "source_file": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Scripts/World/MainQuest04FieldFlow.cs",
      "source_line": "234",
      "asset": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Audio/Voice/Story/Main04/main04_taeon_supp_007.wav",
      "guid": "ddba3d554e929884ca239babdcb04012",
      "sha256": "561b02beb8faa1a4114493e5fa2c8a2b94a0c17474dfc0d5deb59be533f1db65",
      "seconds": 4.23
    },
    {
      "id": "main04_miel_supp_011",
      "quest": 4,
      "speaker": "미엘",
      "character_id": "companion_miel",
      "voice_id": "Sulafat",
      "text": "마을에도 이 상황을 알려야 해요.",
      "source_file": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Scripts/World/MainQuest04FieldFlow.cs",
      "source_line": "235",
      "asset": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Audio/Voice/Story/Main04/main04_miel_supp_011.wav",
      "guid": "3fee2085190461e4eb3a5feec7817284",
      "sha256": "e3171567c5e679d5ba4c6d64ecd2b23bf3d50c82b8e6b3744886febb76e5327e",
      "seconds": 9.31
    },
    {
      "id": "main05_taeon_supp_001",
      "quest": 5,
      "speaker": "태온",
      "character_id": "companion_taeon",
      "voice_id": "Gacrux",
      "text": "몬스터들이 마을 쪽으로 움직이는 건 맞습니다.\n하지만 마을을 노리고 있는 것 같지는 않습니다.",
      "source_file": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Scripts/World/MainQuest05ReturnFlow.cs",
      "source_line": "81",
      "asset": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Audio/Voice/Story/Main05/main05_taeon_supp_001.wav",
      "guid": "ce4de626ea7fb7244b8e8ae2f02f5e53",
      "sha256": "7d3389e5572169ba64e158be7561aa0e6dbfb518b240217aa6bf4a304a9f5f7b",
      "seconds": 10.55
    },
    {
      "id": "main05_miel_supp_001",
      "quest": 5,
      "speaker": "미엘",
      "character_id": "companion_miel",
      "voice_id": "Sulafat",
      "text": "무언가를 피해서 내려오고 있는 것 같아요.",
      "source_file": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Scripts/World/MainQuest05ReturnFlow.cs",
      "source_line": "82",
      "asset": "Unity/Client/Assets/_Project/Audio/Voice/Story/Main05/main05_miel_supp_001.wav",
